<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Menem sees 6.5 pct growth -- report.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Menem sees 6.5 pct growth -- report.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's economy should grow by at least 6.5 percent in 1997, President Carlos Menem told an afternoon newspaper Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Growth will not be less than 6.5 percent this year,&quot; Menem told La Razon in an interview.</p>
<p>Menem earlier in May said that he thought the economy, which grew by 4.4 percent in 1996, would expand by six percent or more.</p>
<p>(( -- Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
